      "html": "<section class=\"margin-block pad-inline pad-block fill-shade border-radius\" aria-labelledby=\"fizzy-connection-title\">\n  <h2 id=\"fizzy-connection-title\" class=\"txt-large\">Fizzy</h2>\n\n\n      <p>Paste a personal access token to preview Fizzy cards in messages and create cards from them. Generate one in Fizzy under your profile → API → Personal access tokens; card creation needs <strong>Read + Write</strong>. The token is validated with Fizzy before it is stored and is never shown again.</p>\n    <form class=\"flex align-center gap\" action=\"/fizzy/connection\" accept-charset=\"UTF-8\" method=\"post\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"authenticity_token\" value=\"post:/fizzy/connection\" />\n      <input class=\"input flex-item-grow\" placeholder=\"Fizzy token…\" autocomplete=\"off\" required=\"required\" aria-label=\"Fizzy personal access token\" type=\"password\" name=\"access_token\" id=\"access_token\" />\n      <input type=\"submit\" name=\"commit\" value=\"Connect Fizzy\" class=\"btn\" data-disable-with=\"Connect Fizzy\" />\n</form></section>\n",
